831270, "raw_content": "Go fuck yourselves. Tired of giving our money away. Give some back. I don't give a fuck about the Nat Debt.. it's never getting paid off. Every dollar they give to foreign countries and foreign invaders creates more debt.. well fuck it.. how about American citizens get some of that cash? If it's our debt to pay off, how about this be the first time that actual citizens \"raised\" it by getting some of it. ", "author": "DeplorableDreg", "created": 1789218784443, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "GentleSlayer", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "Soooooo... They tax us on every single thing we do. They give that money to every country that hates us. They give that money to illegals. Trump says he wants to give back 5k each of that stolen money. And everyone from Desantis on down says it's a bad idea. ", "last_comment_created": 1789261122401, "content": "<p>Go fuck yourselves. Tired of giving our money away. Give some back. I don't give a fuck about the Nat Debt.. it's never getting paid off. Every dollar they give to foreign countries and foreign invaders creates more debt.. well fuck it.. how about American citizens get some of that cash? If it's our debt to pay off, how about this be the first time that actual citizens &quot;raised&quot; it by getting some of it.</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 21, "score_up": 130, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}], "status": true}